  readBy     String             @default("[]") // ׳׳”׳•׳“׳¢׳•׳× ׳׳™׳©׳™׳•׳× - ׳”׳׳ ׳ ׳§׳¨׳
  isArchived Boolean           @default(false) // ׳׳”׳•׳“׳¢׳•׳× ׳׳™׳©׳™׳•׳× - ׳”׳׳ ׳‘׳׳¨׳›׳™׳•׳
  archivedBy String             @default("[]") // ׳׳”׳•׳“׳¢׳•׳× ׳›׳׳׳™׳•׳× - ׳¢׳•׳‘׳“׳™׳ ׳©׳”׳¢׳‘׳™׳¨׳• ׳׳׳¨׳›׳™׳•׳
